This chapter shares only switch, replace, revive and capture.

Use the battle chapter.

The catch rates are rate, in that order:
  "Pidgey" has 255.
  "Rattata" has 255.
  "Spearow" has 255.
  "Caterpie" has 255.
  "Weedle" has 255.
  "Metapod" has 120.
  "Kakuna" has 120.
  "Pikachu" has 190.
  "Nidoran F" has 235.
  "Nidoran M" has 235.

To send a slot (number):
  Let the member be item the slot of Team's members.
  If the member is nothing:
    Stop.
  Set Team's selected to the slot.
  Set Combat's ally to the member.
  Calm the member.

To switch to a slot (number):
  Set Team's notice to "".
  Let the member be item the slot of Team's members.
  If the member is nothing:
    Set Team's notice to "NO POKEMON".
    Stop.
  If the member's health is less than 1:
    Set Team's notice to "FAINTED".
    Stop.
  Send the slot.
  Set Team's notice to "READY".

To revive:
  For each member in Team's members:
    Heal the member.

To replace:
  Set Team's result to "loss".
  Let the slot be 1.
  For each candidate in Team's members:
    If Team's selected is not the slot and the candidate's health is more than 0:
      Send the slot.
      Set Team's result to "replacement".
      Stop repeating.
    Add 1 to the slot.
  If Team's result is "replacement":
    Set Combat's active to 1.
    Set Combat's outcome to "".
    Announce "Go! {Combat's ally's species}!".
    Stop.
  Heal Combat's ally.
  Set Combat's outcome to "loss".

To recruit a fighter:
  Calm the fighter.
  Set the fighter's experience to the experience needed for the fighter's species at the fighter's level.
  Add the fighter to Team's members.

To capture:
  Set Team's result to "".
  If Combat's active is 0 or Combat's challenger is not "wild":
    Set Team's result to "trainer".
    Stop.
  If Team's count is at least 6:
    Set Team's result to "full".
    Stop.
  Let the catch rate be the catch rates for Combat's foe's species.
  If the catch rate is nothing:
    Fail because "No catch rate for {Combat's foe's species}.".
  Roll.
  If Combat's seed is more than the catch rate's rate:
    Set Team's result to "escaped".
    Stop.
  Let the divisor be the larger of 1 and ((Combat's foe's health / 4) rounded down to the nearest 1).
  Let the chance be (Combat's foe's maximum health * 255 / 12) rounded down to the nearest 1.
  Set the chance to the smaller of 255 and ((the chance / the divisor) rounded down to the nearest 1).
  Roll.
  If Combat's seed is more than the chance:
    Set Team's result to "escaped".
    Stop.
  Recruit Combat's foe.
  Set Combat's active to 0.
  Set Combat's outcome to "caught".
  Report "Caught {Combat's foe's species}!".
  Set Team's result to "caught".
